        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate your own cookies.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate by drawing icing on gingerbread cookies, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can change the color of the icing, and you can also change the color of the cookie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897740/extras/17b8d4ac08b045e42d1766534d10684a.poster.avif?t=1782910900\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897740/extras/17b8d4ac08b045e42d1766534d10684a.webm?t=1782910900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make up your own scene.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story by placing decorated cookies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move, rotate, and set cookies to large or small. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your decorated scene as your main title scene and set it as your own game background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897740/extras/62f97aa9bb1c4692eabd156e07f1173c.poster.avif?t=1782910900\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897740/extras/62f97aa9bb1c4692eabd156e07f1173c.webm?t=1782910900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897740/extras/62f97aa9bb1c4692eabd156e07f1173c.mp4?t=1782910900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
